        "chosen_instruction": "###Task Description:\nAn instruction (might include an Input inside it), a response to evaluate, a reference answer that gets a score of 5, and a score rubric representing a evaluation criteria are given.\n1. Write a detailed feedback that assess the quality of the response strictly based on the given score rubric, not evaluating in general.\n2. After writing a feedback, write a score that is an integer between 1 and 5. You should refer to the score rubric.\n3. The output format should look as follows: \"Feedback: (write a feedback for criteria) [RESULT] (an integer number between 1 and 5)\"\n4. Please do not generate any other opening, closing, and explanations.\n\n###The instruction to evaluate:\nA user is seeking information about the history and cultural significance of the Eiffel Tower. The question is asked in five different languages: English, French, German, Spanish, and Japanese. The queries are as follows: \n1. \"What is the history and cultural significance of the Eiffel Tower?\" (English)\n2. \"Quelle est l'histoire et la signification culturelle de la Tour Eiffel?\" (French)\n3. \"Was ist die Geschichte und kulturelle Bedeutung des Eiffelturms?\" (German)\n4. \"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es la historia y la importancia cultural de la Torre Eiffel?\" (Spanish)\n5. \"\u30a8\u30c3\u30d5\u30a7\u30eb\u5854\u306e\u6b74\u53f2\u3068\u6587\u5316\u7684\u610f\u7fa9\u306f\u4f55\u3067\u3059\u304b?\" (Japanese)\n\n###Response to evaluate:\nThe Eiffel Tower, a symbol of Paris, was designed by Gustave Eiffel for the 1889 World's Fair, marking the 100th anniversary of the French Revolution. Today, it's one of the world's most recognized structures.\n\nLa Tour Eiffel, un symbole de Paris, a \u00e9t\u00e9 con\u00e7ue par Gustave Eiffel pour l'Exposition universelle de 1889, c\u00e9l\u00e9brant le centenaire de la R\u00e9volution fran\u00e7aise. Aujourd'hui, c'est l'une des structures les plus reconnues au monde.\n\nDer Eiffelturm, ein Symbol f\u00fcr Paris, wurde von Gustave Eiffel f\u00fcr die Weltausstellung 1889 entworfen, zum 100. Jahrestag der Franz\u00f6sischen Revolution. Heute ist es eine der am meisten erkannten Strukturen der Welt.\n\nLa Torre Eiffel, un simbolo de Paris, fue dise\u00f1ada por Gustave Eiffel para la Exposici\u00f3n Universal de 1889, en conmemoraci\u00f3n del centenario de la Revoluci\u00f3n Francesa. Hoy en d\u00eda, es una de las estructuras m\u00e1s reconocidas del mundo.\n\n\u30a8\u30c3\u30d5\u30a7\u30eb\u5854\u306f\u3001\u30d1\u30ea\u306e\u30b7\u30f3\u30dc\u30eb\u3067\u3042\u308a\u30011889\u5e74\u306e\u4e16\u754c\u535a\u89a7\u4f1a\u306e\u305f\u3081\u306b\u30ae\u30e5\u30b9\u30bf\u30fc\u30f4\u30fb\u30a8\u30c3\u30d5\u30a7\u30eb\u306b\u3088\u3063\u3066\u8a2d\u8a08\u3055\u308c\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002\u3053\u308c\u306f\u3001\u30d5\u30e9\u30f3\u30b9\u9769\u547d100\u5468\u5e74\u3092\u795d\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u4eca\u65e5\u3001\u3053\u308c\u306f\u4e16\u754c\u3067\u6700\u3082\u8a8d\u8b58\u3055\u308c\u3066\u3044\u308b\u69cb\u9020\u306e\u4e00\u3064\u3067\u3059\u3002\n\n###Reference Answer (Score 5):\nThe Eiffel Tower is not only a symbol of Paris but also a monument to human ingenuity. It was designed by Gustave Eiffel for the 1889 Exposition Universelle (World's Fair), held to celebrate the 100th year anniversary of the French Revolution. It was initially criticized by some of France's leading artists and intellectuals for its design but has become a global cultural icon of France and one of the most recognizable structures in the world.\n\nLa Tour Eiffel, symbole de Paris mais aussi monument \u00e0 l'ing\u00e9niosit\u00e9 humaine, a \u00e9t\u00e9 con\u00e7ue par Gustave Eiffel pour l'Exposition universelle de 1889, qui c\u00e9l\u00e9brait le centenaire de la R\u00e9volution fran\u00e7aise. Elle a \u00e9t\u00e9 initialement critiqu\u00e9e par certains des principaux artistes et intellectuels fran\u00e7ais pour sa conception, mais est devenue un embl\u00e8me culturel mondial de la France et l'une des structures les plus reconnaissables au monde. \n\nDer Eiffelturm, nicht nur ein Symbol f\u00fcr Paris, sondern auch ein Denkmal f\u00fcr die menschliche Genialit\u00e4t, wurde von Gustave Eiffel f\u00fcr die Weltausstellung von 1889 entworfen, die zum 100. Jahrestag der Franz\u00f6sischen Revolution abgehalten wurde. Er wurde anfangs von einigen der f\u00fchrenden K\u00fcnstler und Intellektuellen Frankreichs wegen seines Designs kritisiert, ist aber zu einem weltweiten kulturellen Symbol von Frankreich und einer der bekanntesten Strukturen der Welt geworden. \n\nLa Torre Eiffel, no solo un s\u00edmbolo de Par\u00eds, sino tambi\u00e9n un monumento a la ingeniosidad humana, fue dise\u00f1ada por Gustave Eiffel para la Exposici\u00f3n Universal de 1889, que se celebr\u00f3 para conmemorar el centenario de la Revoluci\u00f3n Francesa. Inicialmente fue criticada por algunos de los principales artistas e intelectuales de Francia por su dise\u00f1o, pero se ha convertido en un icono cultural global de Francia y una de las estructuras m\u00e1s reconocibles del mundo. \n\n\u30a8\u30c3\u30d5\u30a7\u30eb\u5854\u306f\u30d1\u30ea\u306e\u8c61\u5fb4\u3067\u3042\u308b\u3060\u3051\u3067\u306a\u304f\u3001\u4eba\u9593\u306e\u5275\u9020\u529b\u3092\u8b83\u3048\u308b\u8a18\u5ff5\u7891\u3067\u3082\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3053\u308c\u306f\u3001\u30d5\u30e9\u30f3\u30b9\u9769\u547d100\u5468\u5e74\u3092\u795d\u3063\u3066\u958b\u50ac\u3055\u308c\u305f1889\u5e74\u306e\u30a8\u30af\u30b9\u30dd\u30b8\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u30fb\u30e6\u30cb\u30d0\u30fc\u30b5\u30eb\uff08\u4e07\u56fd\u535a\u89a7\u4f1a\uff09\u306e\u305f\u3081\u306b\u3001\u30b0\u30b9\u30bf\u30fc\u30d6\u30fb\u30a8\u30c3\u30d5\u30a7\u30eb\u306b\u3088\u3063\u3066\u8a2d\u8a08\u3055\u308c\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002\u5f53\u521d\u306f\u30d5\u30e9\u30f3\u30b9\u306e\u4e3b\u8981\u306a\u82b8\u8853\u5bb6\u3084\u77e5\u8b58\u4eba\u306e\u4e00\u90e8\u304b\u3089\u305d\u306e\u8a2d\u8a08\u306b\u5bfe\u3057\u3066\u6279\u5224\u3055